Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","review_id":"GsjnVNHbNl36CYLYfoCtIw","date":"2021-08-18T21:07:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482421875,"text_excerpt":"The first time I had Beard Papa's was in NYC. So happy they opened a location in NOLA!! Love the cheerfulness of the blue and yellow. The inside is so spacious with plenty of indoor seating. Keep in mind they are enforcing covid-19 regulations of showing proof of vaccination or recent negative test within 3 days. (Thank you! We felt safe dining inside for a bit because of this) LA Wallet is super handy for this if you don't have the paper copy or forgot to take a photo on your phone btw. The cream puffs: SO SO GOOD. You can choose the shell and the filling. I loved the matcha one the best!! We tried the Oreo one with vanilla filling, the ube with ube filling, and the smores one with vanil..."},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","review_id":"I-Tm5TEdGOlxejPzGt3j0w","date":"2021-08-22T07:06:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450545310974121,"text_excerpt":"I am SO glad I had a chance to try this place! I was introduced to this fairly new shop as part of a Yelp Elite Perk. Initial impressions: Minimalist design, clean interior, would be very comfortable to hang out here if it weren't for Covid! They do ask to see your proof of vaccination, so don't forget to bring your vaccination card or have LA Wallet handy. All of their employees had their masks on the entire time as well, so you can feel safe at Beard Papa's. I got some cream puffs complimentary and I also purchased some extras. Each cream puff was about the size of your palm (pretty big, it takes 6 or 7 bites to eat one!) and stuffed with a light fluffy cream that oozes out when you bit..."},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","review_id":"OGb9qi9fRdWyAxzrmN8Tmw","date":"2021-06-27T17:35:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9449598789215088,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by yesterday morning for their grand opening and had a great time!! It was a bit of a wait, but we expected that since it was their first day, and the staff was very nice, welcoming, and attentive during the wait. I loved being able to see orders being made and puffs getting filled with cream. The cream puffs are sooo delicious and there's lots of flavor combinations to choose from. My favorite part is that they don't skimp on the cream filling at all! I hate cream puffs that are all pastry, so Beard Papa's filling their puffs up all the way was so great. The best one I tried was the honey butter puff with vanilla filling. I could tell they make it from real vanilla beans! Green t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","photo_id":"DNJXukLjtYs5EFtQ34kcsw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DNJXukLjtYs5EFtQ34kcsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9251039028167725},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","photo_id":"P24OREoJdA9QQDgCimDiJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/P24OREoJdA9QQDgCimDiJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9018769264221191},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","photo_id":"ng_-X98UkIFdNJty7CCkFw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ng_-X98UkIFdNJty7CCkFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8994755744934082},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","photo_id":"hSgl6WwewoDVD_LpuSuk5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hSgl6WwewoDVD_LpuSuk5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8994110226631165},{"business_id":"Jw6WbQpwQYsQRWJN66ZkPw","photo_id":"_sarm2NBRtWljYEwLVlkLA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_sarm2NBRtWljYEwLVlkLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8966034650802612}]},"notebook_case":null}
